# Production env, committed on purpose.
#
# Only PUBLIC values live here. VITE_API_URL is the base URL of our own backend
# (LAUNCH_PLAN Phase 2: NestJS API on the VPS behind Traefik). It is not a
# secret: every request the browser makes already shows it, and nothing it
# serves is readable without a user's own token (JWT access token + refresh
# token issued by the API and checked on every route, no anon key involved).
#
# NEVER put JWT_SECRET, DATABASE_URL, Resend/Google/Apple secrets here; those
# live in the API's own environment on the server, never in the client bundle.

VITE_API_URL=https://api.letterlock.raltech.dev

# Web "Sign in with Apple" (Apple 4.8). Leave empty until the Services ID exists
# (Apple Developer > Identifiers > Services IDs; return URL
# https://letterlock.raltech.dev/auth/callback). Empty = the button is hidden.
VITE_APPLE_SERVICES_ID=
